  "title": "Sowing the Future",
  "summary": "While many of GTE’s efforts support today’s cacao producers, Sowing the Future (Sembrando Futuro) focuses on those of tomorrow. The program operates at the Rural Ecological Educational Institution El Cuembí in southern Putumayo, helping students from surrounding rural villages see agriculture as dignified work with real economic potential. The initiative builds on previous investments including […]",
